  partName: Exhaust Nozzle
  description: The exhaust nozzle is a large, elongated component positioned at the
    center of the engine, responsible for directing exhaust gases out of the engine
    and optimizing thrust. Its metal-mid material and high vertex count indicate
    a focus on durability and high-temperature resistance. The exhaust nozzle plays
    a critical role in achieving efficient exhaust flow and minimizing backpressure.
